---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Home" description="Max Weiner — Customer Success, AI, Builder">

  <div class="mw-hero">
    <h1 class="mw-hero-headline">Max Weiner<em>Customer Success Leader <span class="mw-sep">·</span> CS &amp; AI Strategist <span class="mw-sep">·</span> Coach</em></h1>
  </div>

  <div class="mw-intro">
    <p>I, along with 1,100 of my closest friends, was part of a "reduction in force" in May. While never a fun experience, this wasn't my first rodeo, and severance bought me a few months and no meetings, so I'm rebuilding this site.</p>
    <p>While I don't intend to become a LinkedIn influencer, it was time to rebrand this website from a grad school project into something more using AI. I consider myself a builder - whether customer success playbooks, value for customers, or something more impactful - I like sweating the details, digging into the data, and working with people to make something better.</p>
    <p>When I coach job seekers, I often remind them of the powerful phrase "for now."</p>
    <p><em>For now</em>, I plan to use this site as a creative outlet - to experiment with AI, website development, and generally see where the road takes me. You can expect to find projects in various states of done, musings about Customer Success and/or AI, more information about my background, and an archived version of a 2019 site I built for a grad school marketing class that includes my mom's lasagna recipe (that last one is worth a click).</p>
  </div>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Override Layout's main constraints so sections control their own spacing */
  :global(main) {
    max-width: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .mw-hero {
    padding: 5.5rem 3rem 3rem;
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

.mw-hero-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-ubuntu);
    font-size: 52px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .mw-hero-headline em {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 22px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .mw-sep {
    font-style: normal;
    margin: 0 0.45rem;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .mw-intro {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem 3rem 6rem;
  }

  .mw-intro p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .mw-intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .mw-intro em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

</style>
